description=Keeps what the world still needs from mods removed from CookieCheetah, with no Lua code: tiles of Building Clipboard (stairs, roof pieces), Blackout Predators Extended (nest props), Kentucky Cannabis (crops, planters, hydroponics, workstations) and Monorails (track, stations) so objects already in the world keep their picture and stairs still work; picture-only stubs for Kentucky Cannabis' seven and Monorails' 37 build entities (no recipe, no crafting, no UI) and name-only stubs for Ammo Maker's three entities (bird feeder, electrolysis setup, nitre bed) so the world still loads. Never turn it on together with the mods it replaces (same tile numbers / entity names).
